<tbody>
<tr><td>Scope</td><td>Damaged items or whole elevations are left out</td><td>Re-inspection with photos tied to each line item</td></tr>
<tr><td>Measurements</td><td>Roof squares, pitch, waste, or wall areas are understated</td><td>Independent measurements or aerial reports</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pricing</td><td>Unit costs do not reflect current Dallas-area labor and materials</td><td>Comparison with local contractor bids and pricing data</td></tr>
<tr><td>Depreciation</td><td>Excessive or non-recoverable depreciation applied</td><td>Review of policy valuation terms and the age and condition of materials</td></tr>
